# Forge3D example: animated scene (spin + bob + pulse)
# Small 320x240 scene, 2 seconds at 15 fps = 30 frames, for fast renders.
scene size 320 240 background black
camera at 4 3 6 look 0 0 0
cube spinner red at -2 0 0
sphere bouncer blue at 0 0 0
pyramid pulser green at 2 0 0
animate spinner spin y speed 180 duration 2 fps 15
bob bouncer amplitude 0.5 duration 2 fps 15
pulse pulser duration 2 fps 15
render duration 2 fps 15
